The XIII UNL School will take place at the National Academy of Sciences Gallery, in Yerevan, Armenia, from October 7th to 11th, 2013, in conjunction with [http://www.csit.am/2013/ CSIT 2013].

== Important Dates ==
*<strike>1-18/Aug/2013: Applications</strike>
*<strike>1/Sep/2013: Notification of accepted candidates</strike>
*7-11/Oct/2013: XIII UNL School

== Program ==
*Monday, Oct 7th: 
**Introduction
**NLization (UGO)
*Tuesday, Oct 8th:
**UNLization (CORNELIA)
*Wednesday, Oct 9th:
**Grammar (Morphology): inflectional paradigms and subcategorization frames
*Thursday, Oct 10th:
**Dictionary (MIR, BRUNO and NADIA)
*Friday, Oct 11th:
**Discussion and Evaluation

